" (or set CR_TRUSTED_HOSTS to trust a hostname without Serve)."
msgstr ""
"--tailscale-host / --tailscale-port 用于配置 Serve；请同时传入 --tailscale（或设置 "
"CR_TRUSTED_HOSTS 以在不使用 Serve 的情况下信任某个主机名）。"

#: packages/clear-record/src/clear_record/web/__init__.py:218
#, python-brace-format
msgid "--tailscale-port {port} is not a port number (1-65535)."
msgstr "--tailscale-port {port} 不是有效的端口号（1–65535）。"

#: packages/clear-record/src/clear_record/web/__init__.py:320
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"--tailscale sets up Tailscale Serve against http://127.0.0.1:<port>, but "
"--host {host!r} is not a loopback address, so Serve could not reach the "
"console.\n"
"  Drop --host (the console binds 127.0.0.1 by default), or drop "
"--tailscale and front the loopback console with your own proxy "
"(ADR-0021)."
msgstr ""
"--tailscale 会针对 http://127.0.0.1:<port> 配置 Tailscale Serve，但 --host "
"{host!r} 不是回环地址，Serve 无法访问该控制台。\n"
"  请去掉 --host（控制台默认绑定 127.0.0.1），或去掉 "
"--tailscale，改用自己的代理置于回环控制台之前（ADR-0021）。"

#: packages/clear-record/src/clear_record/web/__init__.py:351
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"--tailscale-host {override!r} is not a bare hostname.\n"
"    Fix: pass the name Tailscale gives you, e.g. machine.tailnet.ts.net."
msgstr ""
"--tailscale-host {override!r} 不是裸主机名。\n"
"    修正：传入 Tailscale 分配给你的名称，例如 machine.tailnet.ts.net。"

#: packages/clear-record/src/clear_record/web/__init__.py:365
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"[tailscale] {error}\n"
"    The console is starting anyway, but it will not be reachable over the"
" tailnet."
msgstr ""
"[tailscale] {error}\n"
"    控制台仍会启动，但无法通过 tailnet 访问。"

#: packages/clear-record/src/clear_record/web/__init__.py:377
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"[tailscale] port {port} is already served by Tailscale; leaving that "
"mapping untouched.\n"
"    If it does not point at this console, pass --tailscale-port <port> to"
" expose a different tailnet port."
msgstr ""
"[tailscale] 端口 {port} 已由 Tailscale 提供服务；保留该映射不变。\n"
"    如果它并未指向此控制台，请传入 --tailscale-port <port> 以暴露另一个 tailnet 端口。"

#: packages/clear-record/src/clear_record/web/__init__.py:387
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"[tailscale] console is now shared on your tailnet:\n"
"    {url}\n"
"    The tailnet is the authentication: anyone on your tailnet can reach "
"this console.\n"
"    Serve runs in the foreground and stops with this console."
msgstr ""
"[tailscale] 控制台现已在你的 tailnet 上共享：\n"
"    {url}\n"
"    tailnet 即身份验证：你 tailnet 上的任何人都能访问此控制台。\n"
"    Serve 在前台运行，并随此控制台一起停止。"

